    "description": "Watchtower, level 1 of 3: shell and fittings (what soldiers build first). Log watchtower: spiral stair inside four posts up to a railed lookout (floor at y 4), hip roof; L2 walls the base with arrow slits, awning and bell; L3 adds a pointed cap with a flag. 4 x 4 core, not 3 x 3 (a walkable stair needs it).",
